    "Are the number of dairy cows and the number of chickens required to be whole numbers (integers), or can they be treated as continuous values?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the variable type (integer vs. continuous) for both animal counts, which constitutes one semantic decision point."
}

